8
00:00:19,976 --> 00:00:21,901
Now, close the biggest market.

9
00:00:22,501 --> 00:00:25,276
It replans at once, zero rule breaks.

10
00:00:25,726 --> 00:00:27,751
Thirty bad days, it still wins.

